OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fisolated showers around to start
OL,7,Ftonight, merging into more prolonged
OL,8,Fspells of rain early on Wednesday
OL,9,Fmorning, Remaining windy, with near
OL,10,Fgales along the coasts. Feeling
OL,11,Fchillier.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with showery
OL,14,Foutbreaks to start on Wednesday,
OL,15,Fbecoming drier later with sunny spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in any
OL,17,Fsunshine with winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
