OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FTurning more settled, largely dry with
OL,7,Fsunny spells by day. Nights become
OL,8,Fmisty with light winds and clear
OL,9,Fskies, with fog perhaps lingering
OL,10,Fthrough morning. Rain possible later
OL,11,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
